INSERT INTO #Sub VALUES (10, N'A2', 6, 1, N'It is often argued that university education should be provided free of charge, whereas others think that students ought to pay tuition fees. Both sides have their own reasons, and I will examine them in this essay.
INSERT INTO #Sub VALUES (11, N'A2', 8, 1, N'Higher education plays a key role in helping young people build their careers. While some people argue that university should be free for everyone, others believe that students should pay for their own studies. This essay will discuss both views before giving my opinion.
INSERT INTO #Sub VALUES (12, N'A2', 9, 1, N'Nowaday, education is very important for everyone. Some people think university should be free, but other people think student must pay tuition fee. In this essay I will discuss both view.
