INSERT INTO #Sub VALUES (36, N'A7', 1, 1, N'In recent years, technology has transformed the way students learn. While some people argue that digital devices make learning easier and more effective, others claim that they make students lazy and unable to concentrate. This essay will look at both perspectives before giving my own view.
INSERT INTO #Sub VALUES (37, N'A7', 3, 1, N'The rapid spread of digital technology in education has divided opinion. Some argue that it has made learning more convenient and effective, whereas others contend that it has fostered laziness and eroded students'' ability to concentrate. In my view, technology is a powerful aid to learning, provided that it is integrated thoughtfully.
